#showas:全獾
This is one of Badger's favourite scenarios, and should prove a good challenge even to skilled and experienced players.

There are Three level 7 AIs (Royal, Golemite and Full Ensemble) on a 90 planet Clusters map.

There are some Minor Factions out to hurt you; High intensity Marauders, Macrophages, the Dark Spire and Astro Trains.

The Zenith Trader is around to help out, and if you can survive long enough to find the Dyson Sphere they might help too.

Good luck! You're going to need it.